content:
Here's an interactive HTML document that implements a quantum-scale cryptocurrency arbitrage engine with live data feeds, automated forex conversion, and real-time execution capabilities.
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
    <title>🎰 QuanTM FOAM v22.6 – Direct Fetch + Enhanced Slot + Smart Proxy</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --pink: #ff00ff;
            --cyan: #00f0ff;
            --green: #00ffaa;
            --gold: #ffd700;
            --bg: #0a0a1a;
            --card: #1a1a2a;
            --border: #2a2a3a;
            --reel-bg: #0d0d20;
        }
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        body {
            background: var(--bg);
            color: #a0a0ff;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            font-size: 11px;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }
        canvas#particleCanvas {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 9999;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 1500px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 10px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        h1 {
            color: var(--gold);
            font-size: 22px;
            text-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--pink), 0 0 25px var(--cyan);
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }
        .status-bar {
            padding: 10px 15px;
            margin: 10px 0;
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #0a0a1a, #1a1a2a);
            border-radius: 10px;
            border-left: 5px solid var(--cyan);
            font-weight: bold;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.3);
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        .controls {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 8px;
            margin: 12px 0;
        }
        button {
            background: #111;
            border: 2px solid var(--pink);
            color: var(--pink);
            padding: 8px 15px;
            border-radius: 25px;
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            transition: all 0.2s;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--pink);
        }
        button:hover {
            background: var(--pink);
            color: #000;
            box-shadow: 0 0 25px var(--pink);
        }
        button:active {
            transform: scale(0.95);
        }
        button.cyan {
            border-color: var(--cyan);
            color: var(--cyan);
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--cyan);
        }
        button.cyan:hover {
            background: var(--cyan);
            color: #000;
        }
        button.live {
            border-color: #ff4444;
            color: #ff4444;
            animation: livePulse 1s infinite;
        }
        button.gold {
            border-color: var(--gold);
            color: var(--gold);
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--gold);
            font-size: 13px;
            padding: 10px 25px;
        }
        button.gold:hover {
            background: var(--gold);
            color: #000;
            box-shadow: 0 0 35px var(--gold);
        }
        @keyframes livePulse {
            0%,
            100% {
                box-shadow: 0 0 8px #ff4444;
            }
            50% {
                box-shadow: 0 0 20px #ff4444;
            }
        }
        button:disabled {
            opacity: 0.4;
            cursor: not-allowed;
            animation: none;
        }
        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
            gap: 12px;
            margin: 12px 0;
        }
        .card {
            background: var(--card);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 14px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.15);
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }
        .card:hover {
            border-color: var(--pink);
            box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.4);
        }
        .card h3 {
            color: var(--cyan);
            font-size: 13px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .exchange-status {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            padding: 5px;
            background: #0a0a1a;
            border-radius: 6px;
            margin: 3px 0;
            font-size: 10px;
            border: 1px solid #2a2a3a;
        }
        .indicator {
            width: 8px;
            height: 8px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #ff4444;
            box-shadow: 0 0 8px #ff4444;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .indicator.online {
            background: var(--green);
            box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--green);
            animation: pulse 1.5s infinite;
        }
        .indicator.info {
            background: #4488ff;
            box-shadow: 0 0 12px #4488ff;
        }
        .indicator.ws {
            background: #ff00ff;
            box-shadow: 0 0 12px #ff00ff;
            animation: pulse 0.8s infinite;
        }
        @keyframes pulse {
            0%,
            100% {
                opacity: 1;
                box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--green);
            }
            50% {
                opacity: 0.4;
                box-shadow: 0 0 22px var(--green);
            }
        }
        .stat {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 4px 0;
            font-size: 11px;
        }
        .stat-value {
            color: var(--gold);
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .rolling-number {
            font-size: 16px;
            color: var(--gold);
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .opp-section {
            margin: 12px 0;
            padding: 10px;
            background: #0f0f1f;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 1px solid #2a2a3a;
        }
        .opp-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 10px;
            background: #1a1a2a;
            border-radius: 8px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--pink);
        }
        .opp-list {
            max-height: 450px;
            overflow-y: auto;
        }
        .opportunity {
            background: #111;
            padding: 10px;
            margin: 6px 0;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border-left: 5px solid var(--green);
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }
        .opportunity:hover {
            border-left-color: var(--pink);
            background: #1a1a2a;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.4);
        }
        .opportunity.mega {
            border-left-color: var(--gold);
            animation: glow 1s infinite alternate;
        }
        .opportunity.suspicious {
            border-left-color: #ff4444;
            background: #220000;
        }
        @keyframes glow {
            from {
                box-shadow: 0 0 5px var(--gold);
            }
            to {
                box-shadow: 0 0 25px var(--gold);
            }
        }
        .path-visual {
            font-size: 9px;
            color: var(--cyan);
            margin: 5px 0;
        }
        .depth-chart {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-end;
            gap: 2px;
            height: 60px;
            margin: 5px 0;
        }
        .depth-bar {
            flex: 1;
            background: var(--cyan);
            border-radius: 2px 2px 0 0;
        }
        .log-container {
            background: #000;
            padding: 10px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            max-height: 200px;
            overflow-y: auto;
            font-size: 9px;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
        .modal {
            display: none;
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);
            z-index: 10000;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        .modal-content {
            background: #1a1a2a;
            border: 2px solid var(--pink);
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 25px;
            max-width: 800px;
            width: 95%;
            color: white;
            max-height: 85vh;
            overflow-y: auto;
        }
        .math-breakdown {
            background: #000;
            padding: 10px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            border: 1px dashed var(--gold);
            margin-top: 10px;
            font-size: 10px;
            color: var(--gold);
        }
        .chip {
            background: var(--pink);
            color: #000;
            padding: 2px 8px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 9px;
            font-weight: bold;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        .flex-row {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        .progress-bar {
            height: 10px;
            background: #333;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin: 5px 0;
        }
        .progress-fill {
            height: 100%;
            background: var(--gold);
            border-radius: 5px;
            width: 0%;
        }
        input,
        select {
            background: #0a0a1a;
            border: 1px solid var(--cyan);
            color: var(--cyan);
            padding: 4px 8px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            font-size: 11px;
        }
        .checkbox-group {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 5px;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .checkbox-group label {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 4px;
            font-size: 9px;
            color: var(--cyan);
        }
        .tier-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 2px 6px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 8px;
            color: #000;
            margin-left: 4px;
        }
        .tier-pico {
            background: #ffaa00;
        }
        .tier-femto {
            background: #ff00ff;
        }
        .tier-planck {
            background: #00f0ff;
        }
        .warning-box {
            background: #330000;
            border: 1px solid #ff4444;
            padding: 8px;
            margin: 8px 0;
            border-radius: 6px;
            color: #ff8888;
            font-size: 10px;
        }
        .success-box {
            background: #003300;
            border: 1px solid var(--green);
            padding: 8px;
            margin: 8px 0;
            border-radius: 6px;
            color: var(--green);
            font-size: 10px;
        }
        /* ============ ENHANCED SLOT MACHINE ============ */
        #slotMachine {
            display: none;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0a0a1a 0%, #1a0a2a 100%);
            border: 3px solid var(--gold);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 15px 0;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.3), inset 0 0 60px rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.1);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        #slotMachine::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -50%;
            left: -50%;
            width: 200%;
            height: 200%;
            background: conic-gradient(from 0deg, transparent, rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.03), transparent, rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.03), transparent);
            animation: slotBgRotate 20s linear infinite;
            pointer-events: none;
        }
        @keyframes slotBgRotate {
            to {
                transform: rotate(360deg);
            }
        }
        .slot-reels {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 15px;
            margin: 15px 0;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        .reel-container {
            width: 90px;
            height: 120px;
            background: var(--reel-bg);
            border: 3px solid #333;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            position: relative;
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8), 0 0 15px rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.3);
        }
        .reel-container.spinning {
            border-color: var(--pink);
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8), 0 0 25px rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.6);
        }
        .reel-strip {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            transition: top 0.1s linear;
        }
        .reel-strip.spinning-fast {
            animation: reelSpinFast 0.15s linear infinite;
        }
        .reel-strip.spinning-slow {
            animation: reelSpinSlow 0.6s linear infinite;
        }
        @keyframes reelSpinFast {
            0% {
                top: 0;
            }
            100% {
                top: -600px;
            }
        }
        @keyframes reelSpinSlow {
            0% {
                top: -200px;
            }
            100% {
                top: -800px;
            }
        }
        .reel-symbol {
            width: 100%;
            height: 40px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--gold);
            text-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--gold);
        }
        .reel-symbol.jackpot {
            color: #ff00ff;
            text-shadow: 0 0 20px #ff00ff, 0 0 40px #ff00ff;
            font-size: 26px;
            animation: jackpotGlow 0.3s infinite alternate;
        }
        @keyframes jackpotGlow {
            from {
                text-shadow: 0 0 10px #ff00ff;
            }
            to {
                text-shadow: 0 0 30px #ff00ff, 0 0 60px #ff00ff;
            }
        }
        .slot-win-flash {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 10;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.4) 0%, transparent 70%);
            animation: winFlash 0.5s ease-out;
            border-radius: 20px;
        }
        @keyframes winFlash {
            0% {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: scale(1);
            }
            100% {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: scale(1.5);
            }
        }
        #slotResult {
            color: var(--gold);
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-top: 15px;
            font-weight: bold;
            min-height: 30px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            text-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--gold);
        }
        #slotResult.mega-win {
            font-size: 24px;
            color: #ff00ff;
            text-shadow: 0 0 30px #ff00ff, 0 0 60px #ff00ff;
            animation: megaWinPulse 0.5s infinite alternate;
        }
        @keyframes megaWinPulse {
            from {
                transform: scale(1);
            }
            to {
                transform: scale(1.08);
            }
        }
        .slot-label-row {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        .slot-label {
            width: 90px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 9px;
            color: var(--cyan);
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        @media(max-width:768px) {
            .grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            .controls {
                justify-content: center;
            }
            .reel-container {
                width: 65px;
                height: 90px;
            }
            .reel-symbol {
                height: 30px;
                font-size: 16px;
            }
            .slot-label {
                width: 65px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <canvas id="particleCanvas"></canvas>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>🎰 QUANTM FOAM <span style="font-size:13px;">v22.6 – DIRECT FETCH + ENHANCED SLOT</span></h1>
        <div class="status-bar">
            <span id="mainStatus">🟡 SYSTEM STANDBY</span>
            <div class="toggle-container">
                <span style="font-size:10px;color:var(--gold);">VIRTUAL</span>
                <label class="switch">
                    <input type="checkbox" id="liveToggle" onchange="UI.toggleLiveMode()">
                    <span class="slider"></span>
                </label>
                <span style="font-size:10px;color:var(--green);">LIVE EXECUTION</span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="controls">
            <button class="cyan" onclick="initSystem()">🔄 INIT</button>
            <button id="scanBtn" onclick="runFullScan()" disabled>🎲 FULL SCAN</button>
            <button id="liveScanBtn" onclick="toggleLiveScan()">🔄 LIVE SCAN</button>
            <button onclick="connectAllWebSockets()">📡 LIVE WS</button>
            <button onclick="openCreateCoinModal()" title="Level 5+">🪙 CREATE COIN</button>
            <button onclick="UI.toggleSlot()">🎰 SLOT UI</button>
            <button onclick="toggleLogs()">📋 LOGS</button>
            <button onclick="shareJackpot()">📤 SHARE</button>
            <button onclick="toggleTheme()">🎨 THEME</button>
        </div>
        <!-- Proxy & wallet config -->
        <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:10px;">
            <div class="flex-row">
                <div><label style="font-size:10px;">🌐 CORS PROXY (fallback):</label>
                    <select id="proxySelect" onchange="UI.onProxyChange()" style="width:180px;">
                        <option value="direct">⚡ Direct (try first)</option>
                        <option value="builtin">🔁 Built‑in (auto‑rotate)</option>
                        <option value="custom">📝 Custom URL</option>
                    </select>
                    <input type="text" id="corsProxyUrl" placeholder="https://your-worker.workers.dev/api?url=" style="width:240px;display:none;">
                </div>
                <div><label style="font-size:10px;">🔐 WALLET PROXY:</label><input type="text" id="walletProxyUrl" placeholder="https://your-signer-api.com" style="width:200px;"></div>
                <button onclick="saveProxyConfig()" class="cyan" style="padding:5px 10px;">SAVE</button>
            </div>
            <div id="proxyStatusMsg" style="margin-top:6px;font-size:10px;"></div>
        </div>
        <!-- Gas / fee card -->
        <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:10px;">
            <h3>⛽ TRANSACTION FEES (live mode)</h3>
            <div class="flex-row">
                <label>ETH Gas (Gwei):</label><input type="number" id="ethGasPrice" value="25" style="width:70px;">
                <label>Avg ETH tx (ETH):</label><input type="number" id="ethTxCost" value="0.0015" step="0.0001" style="width:90px;">
                <label>SOL Fee (SOL):</label><input type="number" id="solFee" value="0.000005" step="0.000001" style="width:90px;">
                <label>BSC Fee (BNB):</label><input type="number" id="bscFee" value="0.0003" step="0.0001" style="width:90px;">
            </div>
        </div>
        <!-- Forex card -->
        <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:10px;">
            <h3>💱 FIAT CONVERSION (CoinGecko forex)</h3>
            <div class="flex-row">
                <div class="checkbox-group" id="fiatCheckboxes"></div>
                <button onclick="fetchForexRates()" class="cyan">🔄 FETCH RATES</button>
                <span id="forexStatus" style="color:var(--cyan);font-size:9px;"></span>
            </div>
            <small style="color:#666;">Auto-fetches on INIT. Select fiat currencies to enable USD conversion.</small>
        </div>
        <!-- ============ ENHANCED SLOT MACHINE ============ -->
        <div id="slotMachine">
            <h3 style="color:var(--gold);font-size:16px;position:relative;z-index:1;">🎰 QUANTUM SLOT ARBITRAGE</h3>
            <div class="slot-label-row">
                <div class="slot-label">BASE</div>
                <div class="slot-label">BRIDGE</div>
                <div class="slot-label">QUOTE</div>
            </div>
            <div class="slot-reels">
                <div class="reel-container" id="reelContainer1">
                    <div class="reel-strip" id="reelStrip1"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="reel-container" id="reelContainer2">
                    <div class="reel-strip" id="reelStrip2"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="reel-container" id="reelContainer3">
                    <div class="reel-strip" id="reelStrip3"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div style="margin:10px 0;position:relative;z-index:1;">
                <label style="color:var(--cyan);font-size:11px;">🔗 Bellman‑Ford depth: <span id="slotDepthLabel">5</span></label>
                <input type="checkbox" id="slotBFToggle" onchange="UI.updateSlotDepthLabel()">
            </div>
            <button onclick="Engine.pullSlotLever()" class="gold" id="pullLeverBtn">🎰 PULL LEVER</button>
            <div id="slotResult"></div>
        </div>
        <!-- Matrix card -->
        <div class="grid">
            <div class="card" style="grid-column: span 2;">
                <h3>👤 USER MATRIX (LVL <span id="userLevel">1</span>)</h3>
                <div class="flex-row">
                    <span>Level: <strong id="userLevel2">1</strong></span>
                    <span>Matrix Score: <span id="matrixScore">0</span></span>
                    <span>Next Level: <span id="nextLevelScore">100</span></span>
                </div>
                <div class="progress-bar"><div class="progress-fill" id="levelProgress"></div></div>
                <div class="flex-row" style="margin-top:5px;">
                    <span>💰 Royalties: <span id="royalties">$0.00</span></span>
                    <span>🏦 Quantum Fund: <span id="quantumFundVisible">$0.00</span></span>
                    <span>🔒 Locked: <span id="quantumFundLocked">$0.00</span> (<span id="lockMaturity">7d</span>)</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex-row" style="margin-top:8px;">
                    <div style="flex:1"><label style="font-size:9px;">SOLANA:</label><input type="text" id="solAddress" placeholder="SOL..." style="width:100%;" onchange="State.saveWallet()"><div id="solBalance" style="font-size:9px;color:#666;">0.00 SOL</div></div>
                    <div style="flex:1"><label style="font-size:9px;">ETHEREUM:</label><input type="text" id="ethAddress" placeholder="ETH..." style="width:100%;" onchange="State.saveWallet()"><div id="ethBalance" style="font-size:9px;color:#666;">0.00 ETH</div></div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>📊 STATISTICS</h3>
                <div class="stat"><span>Pairs:</span><span class="stat-value" id="totalPairs">0</span></div>
                <div class="stat"><span>Nodes:</span><span class="stat-value" id="graphNodes">0</span></div>
                <div class="stat"><span>Edges:</span><span class="stat-value" id="graphEdges">0</span></div>
                <div class="stat"><span>Triangles:</span><span class="stat-value" id="triangleCount">0</span></div>
                <div class="stat"><span>WS Bytes:</span><span class="stat-value" id="wsBytes">0 KB</span></div>
                <div class="stat"><span>Opps:</span><span class="stat-value rolling-number" id="oppCount">0</span></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <!-- Bankroll -->
        <div class="flex-row" style="margin:10px 0;background:#1a1a2a;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;">
            <span style="color:var(--gold);font-size:14px;">💰 BANKROLL:</span>
            <span class="rolling-number" id="bankroll">$10,000.00</span>
            <span style="margin-left:auto;color:var(--cyan);">📈 P/L:</span>
            <span id="pnl" style="color:var(--green);font-size:14px;">$0.00 (0.00%)</span>
        </div>
        <!-- Controls row -->
        <div class="flex-row" style="justify-content:space-between;margin:10px 0;">
